  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.58 - AM001 reverse-map, Nullable, and fixer hardening\n- Direction-preserving mismatch keys so ReverseMap reports both conversion directions\n- Narrow generic deferral to collections only (Nullable<T> scalar mismatches report again)\n- Peel Nullable<T> in fixer; invariant-culture Parse/ToString; keyword EscapeIdentifier\n- Framework scalar conversions (DateTime/Uri/bool/Guid/DateOnly/TimeOnly)",
